    <!--
        Glass catalog — real product names matching supplier nomenclature.
        noupdate="1": these records are created once; admin-entered prices survive upgrades.

        Construction key:
          5/16"  = 1/8" HS + 0.090 PVB + 1/8" HS  (two 1/8" lites, laminated)
          7/16"  = 3/16" HS + 0.090 PVB + 3/16" HS (two 3/16" lites, laminated)
          13/16" = insulated laminated (spec TBD)

        Weight reference:
          1/8"  glass ≈ 1.64 lbs/sqft → two lites ≈ 3.28 lbs/sqft  (5/16")
          3/16" glass ≈ 2.45 lbs/sqft → two lites ≈ 4.90 lbs/sqft  (7/16")
    -->

